{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17754","headline":"奉酬端公春雪见寄 · 杨巨源","name":"奉酬端公春雪见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"造化多情状物亲，剪花铺玉万重新。\n闲飘上路呈丰岁，狂舞中庭学醉春。\n兴逸何妨寻剡客，唱高还肯寄巴人。\n遥知独立芝兰阁，满眼清光压俗尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}